{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":8},"Au Clemenceau","Ils s’appellent Gérard, Choukri ou l'Alsacien, gratteurs de FDJ ou leveurs de coude d'un soir, ils se retrouvent dans un bar-tabac PMU, par habitude ou pour tromper leur solitude. Certains vivent dans la rue, d’autres ont connu les hôpitaux psychiatriques, la plupart souffrent d’addictions. Ils sont le pouls et la confidence d'une France déchirée. Ici c'est une famille, c'est une estrade, c'est un ancrage. Ils sont AU CLEMENCEAU.",[4,5,6,7],"homelessness","precarity","substance abuse","mental illness",{"type":9,"id":10,"slug":11,"title":12,"release":14,"filmType":18,"directors":19,"genre":27,"media":29,"synopsis":32,"production":33,"characters":36,"roles":37,"awards":42,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_171","fr2023-171-au-clemenceau",{"native":1,"english":13},"",{"type":15,"date":16,"year":17},"Theatrical release","2023-09-27",2023,"Fiction film",[20],{"id":21,"slug":22,"name":21,"birthYear":23,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":26},"Xavier Gayan","xavier-gayan",0,"Male identifying","France",[],[28],"Documentary – Observational mode",{"posterUrl":30,"trailerUrl":31},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/252/26/269052/format_page/au-clemenceau.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tGl8Mj_lxKw",{"native":2,"english":13},[34],{"country":25,"share":35},"Majority coproducer",[],[38],{"person":39,"role":41},{"id":21,"slug":22,"name":21,"birthYear":23,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":40},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
